{"id":"56a014e11e7bd842","group":"20","path":"20/20-thm-rice-shapiro.md","title":"c.e. 外延类的有限见证表征","display":"thm-rice-shapiro — c.e. 外延类的有限见证表征","type":"theorem","metadata":{"type":"theorem","book":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)","book_abbrev":"20","label":"20-thm-rice-shapiro","aliases":["20-thm-rice-shapiro"],"display":"thm-rice-shapiro — c.e. 外延类的有限见证表征","chapter":"2","section":"2.4","source_kind":"book-with-local-formalization","verification_status":"proved-in-note","source_reference":"Exercise 2.4.20（完整双向证明）","source_printed_pages":[42,43],"source_pdf_pages":[78,79],"depends_on":["[[20-df-re]]","[[20-df-finite-code]]","[[20-lem-ce-index-upward]]","[[20-lem-ce-index-finite-witness]]","[[20-thm-smn]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"theorem"},{"key":"book","html":"Turing Computability: Theory and Applications (Soare, 2016)"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"20"},{"key":"label","html":"20-thm-rice-shapiro"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>20-thm-rice-shapiro</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"thm-rice-shapiro — c.e. 外延类的有限见证表征"},{"key":"chapter","html":"2"},{"key":"section","html":"2.4"},{"key":"source_kind","html":"book-with-local-formalization"},{"key":"verification_status","html":"proved-in-note"},{"key":"source_reference","html":"Exercise 2.4.20（完整双向证明）"},{"key":"source_printed_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>42</span><span>43</span></div>"},{"key":"source_pdf_pages","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>78</span><span>79</span></div>"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"59004ac6d23e86f8\" href=\"?note=59004ac6d23e86f8\" title=\"20-df-finite-code\">20-df-finite-code</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-3\" data-note=\"1cc216cc0239d1f6\" href=\"?note=1cc216cc0239d1f6\" title=\"20-lem-ce-index-upward\">20-lem-ce-index-upward</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-4\" data-note=\"d8e9868412be2384\" href=\"?note=d8e9868412be2384\" title=\"20-lem-ce-index-finite-witness\">20-lem-ce-index-finite-witness</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-5\" data-note=\"8ba6597a854c206f\" href=\"?note=8ba6597a854c206f\" title=\"20-thm-smn\">20-thm-smn</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\mathcal E\">\\(\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\mathcal E\\)</span> 是 c.e. 集合的外延类。</p>\n<p>直接使用：see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-6\" data-note=\"60af447f5d59a8dc\" href=\"?note=60af447f5d59a8dc\" title=\"20-df-re\">20-df-re</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"59004ac6d23e86f8\" href=\"?note=59004ac6d23e86f8\" title=\"20-df-finite-code\">20-df-finite-code</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"1cc216cc0239d1f6\" href=\"?note=1cc216cc0239d1f6\" title=\"20-lem-ce-index-upward\">20-lem-ce-index-upward</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"d8e9868412be2384\" href=\"?note=d8e9868412be2384\" title=\"20-lem-ce-index-finite-witness\">20-lem-ce-index-finite-witness</a>；see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"8ba6597a854c206f\" href=\"?note=8ba6597a854c206f\" title=\"20-thm-smn\">20-thm-smn</a>。</p>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}rice-shapiro}\\vdash\n\\{e:W_e\\in\\mathcal K\\}\\in\\mathcal E\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists I\\in\\mathcal E\\ \\forall W\\in\\mathcal E\\\n[W\\in\\mathcal K\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists i\\in I\\ (D_i\\subseteq W)].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}rice-shapiro}\\vdash\n\\{e:W_e\\in\\mathcal K\\}\\in\\mathcal E\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists I\\in\\mathcal E\\ \\forall W\\in\\mathcal E\\\n[W\\in\\mathcal K\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists i\\in I\\ (D_i\\subseteq W)].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>右推左：并行枚举 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I\">\\(I\\)</span> 和 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_e\">\\(W_e\\)</span>，等待某个 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in I\">\\(i\\in I\\)</span> 的有限集合 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_i\">\\(D_i\\)</span> 全部出现；该检测一致 c.e.。左推右：令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"S\">\\(S\\)</span> 为给定 c.e. 指标集。s-m-n 给全可计算 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"d\">\\(d\\)</span>，使 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W_{d(i)}=D_i\">\\(W_{d(i)}=D_i\\)</span>，故 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"I=\\{i:d(i)\\in S\\}\">\\(I=\\{i:d(i)\\in S\\}\\)</span> 是 c.e.。若 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"W\\in\\mathcal K\">\\(W\\in\\mathcal K\\)</span>，有限见证引理给 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_i\\subseteq W\">\\(D_i\\subseteq W\\)</span> 且 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"D_i\\in\\mathcal K\">\\(D_i\\in\\mathcal K\\)</span>，所以 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"i\\in I\">\\(i\\in I\\)</span>；反向由向上闭合引理。这完成的是集合外延类版本，不将其偷换成任意部分函数类。</p>\n<p>来源：Exercise 2.4.20（完整双向证明）；印刷页 42, 43；PDF 第 78, 79 页（从 1 起）。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-re]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-finite-code","status":"resolved","id":"59004ac6d23e86f8","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-df-finite-code]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-lem-ce-index-upward","status":"resolved","id":"1cc216cc0239d1f6","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-lem-ce-index-upward]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-lem-ce-index-finite-witness","status":"resolved","id":"d8e9868412be2384","anchor":"ref-4","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-lem-ce-index-finite-witness]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-smn","status":"resolved","id":"8ba6597a854c206f","anchor":"ref-5","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[20-thm-smn]]","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-re","status":"resolved","id":"60af447f5d59a8dc","anchor":"ref-6","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-finite-code]]；see [[20-lem-ce-index-upward]]；see [[20-lem-ce-index-finite-witness]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-df-finite-code","status":"resolved","id":"59004ac6d23e86f8","anchor":"ref-7","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-finite-code]]；see [[20-lem-ce-index-upward]]；see [[20-lem-ce-index-finite-witness]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-lem-ce-index-upward","status":"resolved","id":"1cc216cc0239d1f6","anchor":"ref-8","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-finite-code]]；see [[20-lem-ce-index-upward]]；see [[20-lem-ce-index-finite-witness]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-lem-ce-index-finite-witness","status":"resolved","id":"d8e9868412be2384","anchor":"ref-9","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-finite-code]]；see [[20-lem-ce-index-upward]]；see [[20-lem-ce-index-finite-witness]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]。","embed":false},{"target":"20-thm-smn","status":"resolved","id":"8ba6597a854c206f","anchor":"ref-10","targetAnchor":"","location":"正文","heading":"[Hypothesis]","excerpt":"直接使用：see [[20-df-re]]；see [[20-df-finite-code]]；see [[20-lem-ce-index-upward]]；see [[20-lem-ce-index-finite-witness]]；see [[20-thm-smn]]。","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathcal K\\subseteq\\mathcal E","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{thm\\text{-}rice-shapiro}\\vdash\n\\{e:W_e\\in\\mathcal K\\}\\in\\mathcal E\\Longleftrightarrow\n\\exists I\\in\\mathcal E\\ \\forall W\\in\\mathcal E\\\n[W\\in\\mathcal K\\Longleftrightarrow\\exists i\\in I\\ (D_i\\subseteq W)].","display":true},{"tex":"I","display":false},{"tex":"W_e","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in I","display":false},{"tex":"D_i","display":false},{"tex":"S","display":false},{"tex":"d","display":false},{"tex":"W_{d(i)}=D_i","display":false},{"tex":"I=\\{i:d(i)\\in S\\}","display":false},{"tex":"W\\in\\mathcal K","display":false},{"tex":"D_i\\subseteq W","display":false},{"tex":"D_i\\in\\mathcal K","display":false},{"tex":"i\\in I","display":false}],"bytes":1727,"backlinks":[{"id":"005203b6707a19f4","anchor":"ref-91","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-rice-shapiro]] — 章 2；直接提供者 5 个。"},{"id":"f4368dd1e05cad1f","anchor":"ref-91","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[20-thm-rice-shapiro]]"}],"outgoing":["60af447f5d59a8dc","59004ac6d23e86f8","1cc216cc0239d1f6","d8e9868412be2384","8ba6597a854c206f"]}